# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Coloring Book PDF Generator — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your actual values.
# NEVER commit `.env.local` — it's already in .gitignore.

# ── Turso (libSQL) Database ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://app.turso.tech (web dashboard)
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://coloring-books-YOUR-HANDLE.turso.io
TURSO_DIRECT_URL=libsql://coloring-books-YOUR-HANDLE.turso.io
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-turso-auth-token-here

# ── Vercel Blob (file storage) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Get this from: Vercel Dashboard → your project → Storage → Create Blob Store
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=your-vercel-blob-token-here

# ── App URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# IMAGE GENERATION API KEYS (add any combination — auto-failover)
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The script tries providers in priority order (cheapest first).
# If one hits a rate limit or quota, it automatically falls back.
# Add as many as you want — even 1 is enough to start.

# ── Fal.ai — $0.001/image (CHEAPEST) ────────────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://fal.ai → get API key from dashboard
# FAL_API_KEY=your-fal-key

# ── Together AI — $0.003/image (BEST VALUE) ─────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://together.ai → get API key from Settings → API Keys
# TOGETHER_API_KEY=your-together-key

# ── Replicate — ~$0.003/image ───────────────────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://replicate.com → get API token from Account Settings
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=your-replicate-token

# ── Z.AI — free tier (current provider) ──────────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://z.ai → API Keys
# ZAI_API_KEY=your-zai-key

# ── OpenAI DALL-E 3 — $0.04/image (BEST QUALITY, most expensive) ────
# Sign up: https://platform.openai.com → API Keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-key
